{"text":"And men in general are physically stronger, of course there are many exceptions. But today we live in a vastly different world. The person more likely to lead is not the physically stronger person. It is the more creative person, the more intelligent person, the more innovative person. And there are no hormones for those attributes. A man is as likely as a woman to be intelligent, to be creative, to be innovative. We have evolved, but it seems to me that our ideas of gender have not evolved. Some weeks ago I walked into the lobby of one of the best Nigerian hotels. I thought about naming the hotel but I thought I probably shouldn't. And a guy at the entrance stopped me and asked me annoying questions.","words":[{"text":"And","start":0.0,"end":0.96},{"text":"men","start":0.96,"end":1.14},{"text":"in","start":1.14,"end":1.32},{"text":"general","start":1.32,"end":1.7},{"text":"are","start":1.7,"end":2.36},{"text":"physically","start":2.36,"end":2.62},{"text":"stronger","start":2.62,"end":3.04,"punct":","},{"text":"of","start":3.4,"end":3.54},{"text":"course","start":3.54,"end":3.68},{"text":"there","start":3.68,"end":3.84},{"text":"are","start":3.84,"end":3.92},{"text":"many","start":3.92,"end":4.04},{"text":"exceptions","start":4.04,"end":4.42,"punct":"."},{"text":"But","start":6.84,"end":7.04},{"text":"today","start":7.04,"end":7.44},{"text":"we","start":7.44,"end":7.64},{"text":"live","start":7.64,"end":8.0},{"text":"in","start":8.0,"end":8.22},{"text":"a","start":8.22,"end":8.36},{"text":"vastly","start":8.36,"end":8.98},{"text":"different","start":8.98,"end":9.7},{"text":"world","start":9.7,"end":10.22,"punct":"."},{"text":"The","start":11.22,"end":11.42},{"text":"person","start":11.42,"end":11.62},{"text":"more","start":11.62,"end":11.86},{"text":"likely","start":11.86,"end":12.08},{"text":"to","start":12.08,"end":12.36},{"text":"lead","start":12.36,"end":12.8},{"text":"is","start":12.8,"end":13.3},{"text":"not","start":13.3,"end":13.6},{"text":"the","st